   "lines": [
    "# KatMusic",
    "",
    "",
    "### A YouTube Music player for Android, Windows, macOS and Linux with Listen Together, synced lyrics, offline downloads and shareable KatMusic Codes.",
    "",
    "KatMusic is a free, open-source music player with word-synced lyrics, a",
    "native C++ audio engine with parametric EQ, Listen Together rooms with QR",
    "invites, offline downloads and two interface styles, Classic and Modern. The",
    "Android app is built in Kotlin with Jetpack Compose, and the desktop apps",
    "use Flutter. An Arct Development project.",
    "",
    "Built with Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · Flutter · Media3 · C++ / Oboe",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://katmusic.pages.dev)"
